---
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="dark">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    
    <!-- SEO Meta Tags -->
    <title>About Us — AttendEase Free Attendance Tracker</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Learn about AttendEase, the free attendance tracker app for students. Built to help students track attendance, calculate bunks, and stay on top of academic goals with privacy-first design." />
    <meta name="keywords" content="about us, attendance tracker about, student attendance app, free attendance tracker, AttendEase team" />
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />
    
    <!-- Open Graph -->
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="About Us — AttendEase" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="AttendEase is a free, privacy-first attendance tracker built by students, for students. Learn about our mission and values." />
    
    <!-- Canonical -->
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://atteendease.com/about" />
    
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen bg-bg-primary text-text-primary font-sans">
    <!-- Navigation -->
    <nav class="fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 bg-bg-secondary/80 backdrop-blur-xl border-b border-border">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-md bg-accent flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-white" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M9 11l3 3 8-8"></path>
              <path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">AttendEase</span>
        </a>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
          <a href="/privacy" class="text-sm text-text-secondary hover:text-text-primary transition-colors">Privacy</a>
          <a href="/contact" class="text-sm text-text-secondary hover:text-text-primary transition-colors">Contact</a>
          <a href="/faq" class="text-sm text-text-secondary hover:text-text-primary transition-colors">FAQ</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-24">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mb-8">About AttendEase</h1>
      
      <div class="prose prose-invert prose-lg max-w-none space-y-6">
        <p class="text-text-secondary">AttendEase is a free, privacy-first attendance tracker built by students, for students. We understand the challenges of maintaining attendance in college and university, and we built a tool that makes it easier to stay on top of your academic goals.</p>
        
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Our Mission</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">Our mission is to empower students with a simple, powerful tool to track their attendance without compromising their privacy. We believe that attendance tracking should be effortless, accessible, and completely under the student's control.</p>
        
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">What Makes AttendEase Different</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">Unlike traditional attendance management systems that are designed for institutions and teachers, AttendEase is built exclusively for students. We focus on what matters most to you:</p>
        <ul class="text-text-secondary list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Privacy-First Design:</strong> All your data stays on your device. No account registration, no cloud storage, no data collection.</li>
          <li><strong>Smart Bunk Calculator:</strong> Know exactly how many classes you can skip while maintaining your target attendance percentage.</li>
          <li><strong>Advanced Analytics:</strong> Visualize your attendance patterns with heat maps, trends, and predictions.</li>
          <li><strong>Completely Free:</strong> No subscriptions, no premium features, no hidden costs. Ever.</li>
          <li><strong>Works Offline:</strong> Access your attendance data anytime, even without an internet connection.</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Our Values</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">AttendEase is built on these core principles:</p>
        <ul class="text-text-secondary list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Privacy:</strong> Your data belongs to you. We don't collect, store, or share it.</li>
          <li><strong>Simplicity:</strong> Complex problems should have simple solutions. We make attendance tracking effortless.</li>
          <li><strong>Accessibility:</strong> Good tools should be available to everyone, regardless of budget or technical expertise.</li>
          <li><strong>Transparency:</strong> We're open about how our app works and what it does with your data (nothing).</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Built for Students, by Students</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">AttendEase was created because we experienced the same challenges you face every semester. Worrying about attendance percentages, calculating how many classes you can skip, and trying to maintain your academic standing while balancing work, study, and life. We built the tool we wished we had.</p>
        
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Technology Stack</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">AttendEase is built with modern web technologies to ensure a fast, responsive, and reliable experience:</p>
        <ul class="text-text-secondary list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>Astro - Modern web framework for lightning-fast performance</li>
          <li>Tailwind CSS - Utility-first CSS for beautiful, responsive design</li>
          <li>Vanilla JavaScript - No heavy frameworks, just efficient code</li>
          <li>Browser localStorage - Secure, local data storage</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Our Commitment</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">We're committed to continuously improving AttendEase based on student feedback. Our goal is to provide the best free attendance tracker available, with features that genuinely help students succeed academically.</p>
        
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Get in Touch</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary">Have questions, suggestions, or feedback? We'd love to hear from you. Visit our Contact page to reach out to us.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="py-8 px-4 sm:px-6 border-t border-border">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-md bg-accent flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M9 11l3 3 8-8"></path>
              <path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="text-sm font-medium">AttendEase</span>
        </a>
        <p class="text-xs text-text-muted">© 2026 AttendEase. Free attendance tracker for students.</p>
      </div>
    </footer>

    <style>
      body {
        font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
      }
      .prose h2 {
        color: var(--color-text-primary);
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-top: 2rem;
      }
      .prose p, .prose ul, .prose li {
        color: var(--color-text-secondary);
        line-height: 1.7;
      }
      .prose strong {
        color: var(--color-text-primary);
      }
    </style>
  </body>
</html>
